{"Title":"An Act allowing blood types to be printed on licenses to operate motor vehicles","BillNumber":"H3282","DocketNumber":"HD1259","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"G_C2","Name":"Gerard J. Cassidy","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/G_C2","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T12:19:06.577"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"G_C2","Name":"Gerard J. Cassidy","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/G_C2","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T12:19:06.5766667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3282/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Cassidy of Brockton, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3282) of Gerard J. Cassidy for legislation to authorize the Registry of Motor Vehicles to print blood types on licenses.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSection 8 of Chapter 90 of the General Laws is hereby amended by adding the following paragraph:-\r\n\tAn applicant for a license or renewal thereof may provide the registrar with a statement of such person’s blood type to be printed upon a REAL-ID-compliant license or a Massachusetts license. The registrar shall make provision for an applicant or licensee who so chooses to list such person’s blood type on the license.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}